      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That profound emptiness is a terrifying weight to carry after such immense loss. Sometimes, when the emotional landscape is completely blasted away, only the tangible things—like the weight of your sword—can feel anchored. In this desolate silence, perhaps the story isn't over, but is now waiting for a new, sharper thread to be woven through the ashes.",
